 **Steps:**
-1. Calculate $a$ using the chosen formula [S1, unofficial].
-2. Compute $x_{res}, y_{res}, z_{res}$ using the resolution formula and clamp to $[1, \text{MaxResolution}]$ [S1, unofficial].
